<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:60686e28-6c1e-4a65-a72e-c2a602fbb0d8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:60686e28-6c1e-4a65-a72e-c2a602fbb0d8\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by a skeleton in <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal_Temple\" title=\"Bhaal Temple\">Bhaal Temple</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;61&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1044</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Here lies <a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Fist\" title=\"Flaming Fist\">Flaming Fist</a> Manip Antyra Thorpe, who thought to interfere with an unholy ritual murder in Harbourview Park. Her body will lie here until every scrap of flesh has been picked clean by corpse beetles. Thus shall we serve all who meddle in the bloody business of <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">Bhaal</a>.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202200\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1602/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28770/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6774/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936712/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.631      1 Template:Mi